@startuml
!include style.iuml
left to right direction
class "TitleGameFlow" as flow <<đề xuất>> {
 - board : BoardModel
 - view : BoardView
 + StartLevel()
 + Submit(command)
 + NextLevel()
 + RestoreAfterRevive()
}
class "BoardModel / Rule" as model <<game mới>>
class "BoardView / Input" as view <<game mới>>
class "LevelDatabase" as levels <<game mới>>
class "GameController" as shell <<có sẵn>> {
 {static} + ActivateGame()
 {static} + GameComplete()
 {static} + ShowCompleteUI()
 {static} + GameOver(...)
}
class "UIGame" as hud <<có sẵn>>
interface "IAdsService" as ads <<interface>>
flow --> model : reference
flow --> view : reference
flow --> levels : reference
flow ..> shell : gọi shell API
flow ..> hud : bind / cập nhật HUD
flow --> ads : dependency được truyền vào
note bottom of flow
Đây là thiết kế đề xuất để gắn game mới.
TitleGameFlow / BoardModel / BoardView /
LevelDatabase chưa tồn tại trong template.
end note
@enduml
